  "decision_conditions": [
    "Occupier",
    "The development must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date hereof.\r\rReason: To comply with Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended.",
    "All external facing materials, treatments and finishes shall be implemented as shown on the drawing no. 178 GA001 (No. 5 dated 30/04/2026) and the Planning Statement - 12 Wandle Court Gardens (dated 30-04-2026) we have approved and maintained and retained thereafter. \r\rReason: To ensure compliance with Policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018.",
    "The outbuilding in the rear garden hereby permitted shall be only used for purposes ancillary and incidental to the main dwelling and for no other purposes. It shall not be occupied at any time other than for purposes ancillary to the residential use of the dwelling, known as 12 Wandle Court Gardens, Beddington, CR0 4SR. It shall at no time be used as a separate residential unit. To ensure the ancillary nature of the outbuilding, it shall at no time have:\ri)    a separate postal address,\rii)   its own kitchen or cooking facilities when a bathroom or WC is also present,\riii)  separate meters for the provision of services,\riv)  a separate and registered Land Registry title,\rv)   a separate Council tax account,\rvi)  a separate access independent of the main dwelling house.\r\rReason:  To ensure the ancillary nature of the outbuilding hereby permitted is not used as a separate unit of residential accommodation or for purposes other than that incidental to the enjoyment of the main dwellinghouse in accordance with Policy 9 and 29 of the Sutton Local Plan.",
    "The development must be carried out in accordance with the provisions of drawing no. 178 D001 (no. 5) - Fire Safety Strategy and Fire Safety Statement, prepared by Nicholas Kirk Architects (NK Architects Ltd) and dated 30th April 2026.\r\rReason: To ensure that the development incorporates the necessary fire safety measures in accordance with the Mayor's London Plan Policy D12.\r"
  ],
